body:
I think that's too much detail.

The full motivation can always be traced back to this PR; what's important for users is "what is this (for)" which I think can be answered more easily:

```suggestion
// This is the same as `Error`, and can be cross-converted.
// In contrast to `Error`, it cannot be auto-converted to int or bool.
// Use it when you need to avoid footguns by implicit conversions.
```
